{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And to your seed after you I will give the land.</b> At the end of days I will give your seed the entire globe of the earth — not the land of Israel alone — as it says: וּפָרַצְתָּ יָמָּה וָקֵדְמָה וְצָפֹנָה וָנֶגְבָה (Genesis 28:14), and as it says: וְקַרְקַר כָּל בְּנֵי שֵׁת (Numbers 24:17)."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {0 "Reading לְקֵץ הַיָּמִין as לְקֵץ הַיָּמִים (end of days), taking the final nun as a variant or scribal form of mem."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:33:23.361570332Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}